# Phase F1.1 — Docker smoke test scratch dir (scripts/docker_build_smoke.sh).
# Bind-mounted into the smoke container; never committed.
.docker-smoke-data/
# Phase F1.2 — Docker Compose smoke scratch tree
# (scripts/docker_compose_smoke.sh). Mirrors the operator layout under a
# per-run scratch dir; contains a dev-only random bootstrap secret.
.docker-compose-smoke/

# Phase F1.2 — Docker Compose operator-managed runtime trees. These directories
# are bind-mounted by `docker-compose.yml` and must NEVER be committed:
#   * secrets/ — production bootstrap secret (`./secrets/bootstrap_secret.txt`)
#     leaks the Console API auth key if pushed. The compose smoke creates a
#     dev-only value under a separate scratch path (see
#     `scripts/docker_compose_smoke.sh`) so this rule does not weaken CI.
#   * data/    — semantic store, indexes, state (rebuildable from git).
#   * backups/ — encrypted backup snapshots (F3.1).
#   * config/config.toml — the operator's actual production config (may carry
#     hostnames / OAuth client IDs / wiki paths). The tracked template lives
#     at `examples/config.docker.toml`.
secrets/
data/
backups/
config/config.toml
.env

# Local AI-tooling session state (Playwright MCP screenshots etc.)
.playwright-mcp/

